// Title: User Added To Highly Privileged Group
// ID: 10fb649c-3600-4d37-b1e6-56ea90bb7e09
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2024-02-23
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.persistence, attack.t1098
// Description: Detects addition of users to highly privileged groups via "Net" or "Add-LocalGroupMember".
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

process where (((process.command_line like "*_Group Policy Creator Owners*" or process.command_line like "*_Schema Admins*")) and (((process.command_line like "*_localgroup *" and process.command_line like "*_ /add*")) or ((process.command_line like "*_Add-LocalGroupMember *" and process.command_line like "*_ -Group *"))))
